<title>USA: Astoria holders ok Greater NY merge.</title>
<headline>Astoria holders ok Greater NY merge.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE SUCCESS, N.Y. 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Astoria Financial Corp said Friday  its stockholders approved the proposed acquisition of Greater New  York Savings Bank into Astoria Federal Savings and Loan Association.</p>
<p>The company expects to close the deal September 30.</p>
<p>Astoria Financial announced the $293 million deal in March.</p>
